    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="61">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 61</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="61" corresp="#wit-g-a">[G]if hwa on fyrde gryðbryce fulwyrce, ðolige lifes oððe weregildes.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="61" corresp="#wit-a">Gif hwa on fyrde griðbrice fulwyrce, þolige lifes oððe wæregildes.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="61" corresp="#wit-q">Si quis in exercitu (regis) pacis infractionem perficiat, uitam perdat uel weregildo redimat.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="61" corresp="#wit-b">Griðbryce. Gyf hwa on fyrde griðbryce fulwyrce, ðolie liues oððon weregyldes.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-b">Breach of the peace. If anyone is guilty of a capital deed of violence while serving in the army, he shall lose his life or his wergeld.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">(Bruch des Sonderfriedens. B) Wenn einer in der Landwehr Bruch des Sonderfriedens voll[schwer, durch Todtschlag] verübt, verliere er Leben oder [sein] Wergeld.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">(Breach of special peace. B) If anyone commits a full[-weight] breach of special peace [by homicide] in the army, let him lose life or [his] wergild.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
